-- smucclaw/l4-ide#1102: a copied constant is certified exactly as a local one.
-- Written in this file, `first of nothing` is reported Blocking (D-PARTIAL),
-- and so is `g2`, which reads it. Before the copy was certified with its own
-- module's checker warnings, it was exported with no Blocking note at all, and
-- KIE and Camunda both answered `g2` with null where `l4 run` refuses.
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `export-imported-partial-lib`

GIVEN h IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `g2` h IS h PLUS `first of nothing`
